==================================================
DATA INTEGRITY / IMPORTANT RULE
==================================================

The app must distinguish clearly between:

OBSERVED FACT
DERIVED INDICATOR
POTENTIAL RISK
RECOMMENDATION

Never make a governance assertion that the underlying data cannot support.

Examples:

Correct:
“3,319 files match sensitive filename/path indicators.”

Incorrect:
“3,319 files contain sensitive personal information.”

Correct:
“Joshua is the recorded Modified By user for 6,354 files.”

Incorrect:
“Joshua owns 6,354 files.”

Correct:
“Potential duplicate filename.”

Incorrect:
“Identical document.”

unless file hashes/content prove it.

Where additional data is required, show:

“Additional data source required”

rather than manufacturing a value.

